# pack: config-and-secrets
# version: 1
# Configuration comes from the environment through one resolver; secrets never touch the tree.
R {config} dir:config|configuration|credentials|secrets|env
R {root}   root
C C:twelve-factor-config Configuration is read from the environment through one resolver; secrets never enter the repository
K G config.one-resolver    {config} configuration and credentials are read through one resolver; no scattered process.env reads
K G config.no-secrets-in-tree {root} no secret, token, key, or password is committed; a placeholder plus a resolver name is the only thing in the tree
K G config.env-per-environment {config} a difference between environments is configuration, never a code branch on the environment name
E {config} impl C:twelve-factor-config
